  "title": "Customize the Title Screen [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "タイトル画面をカスタマイズ【RPGツクールMZプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "fc5d0b334b4fc9b0cbbae3c113fd8a2658e11337d95b867e3b87afcd622afc8f",
      "translation": "Customize the Title Screen [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "fc5d0b334b4fc9b0cbbae3c113fd8a2658e11337d95b867e3b87afcd622afc8f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "タイトル画面をカズタマイズします。",
      "sourceHash": "5cfa639009a110ace9ba873e2b12650527fb9e5dc03740722fc5dea57c0461f8",
      "translation": "Customize the title screen.",
      "contextHash": "5cfa639009a110ace9ba873e2b12650527fb9e5dc03740722fc5dea57c0461f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "独自コマンドの追加",
      "sourceHash": "30fa6e04bdacb2d24523eb8cfd5d1af026dae1de3478080949f4cdefdde830ea",
      "translation": "Add custom commands",
      "contextHash": "30fa6e04bdacb2d24523eb8cfd5d1af026dae1de3478080949f4cdefdde830ea"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "コマンドウィンドウのサイズ調整",
      "sourceHash": "66eac94f5ddc12bdc1639238c70a8accd3b51182dfbaa3ea65baa05b7df0f320",
      "translation": "Adjust the command window size",
      "contextHash": "66eac94f5ddc12bdc1639238c70a8accd3b51182dfbaa3ea65baa05b7df0f320"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "コマンドの制御文字の有効化",
      "sourceHash": "0c62921338fa0242d35bcb23d17b57db810920b062069310da69f71dc71d0502",
      "translation": "Enable control characters in commands",
      "contextHash": "0c62921338fa0242d35bcb23d17b57db810920b062069310da69f71dc71d0502"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-004",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "※アイコンやフォントサイズの変更が有効になります。",
      "sourceHash": "b2d86af00f1220a1d81b5842fcd1f643a234a6808e9de755e255ad8dc967b400",
      "translation": "※This enables changes to icons and font size.",
      "contextHash": "b2d86af00f1220a1d81b5842fcd1f643a234a6808e9de755e255ad8dc967b400"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-005",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "ゲーム開始時のＢＧＭをフェードアウトさせない。",
      "sourceHash": "c51ae5ee50667585531443c9b30a0d8eb005b8202899ac3f8d1034d1e10a0014",
      "translation": "Do not fade out the BGM when starting the game.",
      "contextHash": "c51ae5ee50667585531443c9b30a0d8eb005b8202899ac3f8d1034d1e10a0014"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、コマンドウィンドウの配置は、データベースのシステム1で変更できます。",
      "sourceHash": "7e226b05e8c7c4f4a1fa817f4fc451c1b093e47ee8d30afa23d5c4cf5200fe8a",
      "translation": "The command window placement can be changed under System 1 in the database.",
      "contextHash": "7e226b05e8c7c4f4a1fa817f4fc451c1b093e47ee8d30afa23d5c4cf5200fe8a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "ＵＲＬ（Url）",
      "sourceHash": "3cf23c53920cdfc66c2d0fb72af122a120714237ae86bcce92f8629ae2ad1168",
      "translation": "ＵＲＬ（Url）",
      "contextHash": "3795f7cd94d0acee721a48910ee05a3bad8b3527249d6e947ee74b792081c9f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn this feature on in the RPG Maker plugin manager.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＺ専用です。",
      "sourceHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d",
      "translation": "※This plugin is for MZ only.",
      "contextHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-002",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_TitleCustomize.js",
      "sourceHash": "470d97624bbdff5dcfde1f945aee189edbd049e79212fcd9dd75a2cf4f3e3edf",
      "translation": "NRP_TitleCustomize.js",
      "contextHash": "44822600d8d268df7320cc2681e819475638d9ec0779a15102370ce1fbbdde05"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "更新履歴（History）",
      "sourceHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7",
      "translation": "Update History (History)",
      "contextHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-006",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Now available!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "独自コマンドの追加（Add Commands）",
      "sourceHash": "efacb92d9dc0fbf13c44e55221683a7b03b59b8a571d13b1dd797231fef95aa3",
      "translation": "Add Custom Commands (Add Commands)",
      "contextHash": "efacb92d9dc0fbf13c44e55221683a7b03b59b8a571d13b1dd797231fef95aa3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "追加コマンドリストに登録すれば、タイトル画面に独自のコマンドを追加できます。",
      "sourceHash": "813ff5c7f268822d296ff90fb7074d009c584f184ade7d550194c2a8de4f70ca",
      "translation": "You can add custom commands to the title screen by registering them in the Add Command List.",
      "contextHash": "813ff5c7f268822d296ff90fb7074d009c584f184ade7d550194c2a8de4f70ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "スクリプトの実行やＵＲＬの呼び出しが可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "48a73deaf979d39b224a08e027b3693c524e4a3814e6481300c7acadda70abd8",
      "translation": "You can execute scripts or open URLs.",
      "contextHash": "48a73deaf979d39b224a08e027b3693c524e4a3814e6481300c7acadda70abd8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スクリプトの例",
      "sourceHash": "8e7f379aa428eb7d08e62f3abc605172a71eba5d1fe9b54ebdd2ae6763a3ea59",
      "translation": "Script Example",
      "contextHash": "8e7f379aa428eb7d08e62f3abc605172a71eba5d1fe9b54ebdd2ae6763a3ea59"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オプション画面を呼ぶスクリプトです。",
      "sourceHash": "b684836785983de41aa4f4eacb60514c2353de96c2968a334efcffa162459270",
      "translation": "This script opens the Options screen.",
      "contextHash": "b684836785983de41aa4f4eacb60514c2353de96c2968a334efcffa162459270"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "シーン名に応じて変更してください。",
      "sourceHash": "60ce9efedfefea3e7aa6a888813d27b7a6f2a313861e5b5a3c0ee731d15a90c8",
      "translation": "Change it according to the scene name.",
      "contextHash": "60ce9efedfefea3e7aa6a888813d27b7a6f2a313861e5b5a3c0ee731d15a90c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スクリプトの例（SceneGlossary.js）",
      "sourceHash": "438d94ac97d486e352ca8e10b23bda8b1cb7a0d5f3779fa3f860f5f45b6f4516",
      "translation": "Script Example (SceneGlossary.js)",
      "contextHash": "438d94ac97d486e352ca8e10b23bda8b1cb7a0d5f3779fa3f860f5f45b6f4516"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※表示上、改行をしているように見えますが、実際は改行を含めずに一行で記述してください。",
      "sourceHash": "d80830fb689879ba45233c264d8d1632bd3af58cbad93c66c37bd9c8672325f2",
      "translation": "※Although it may appear to contain line breaks, write it on a single line without any line breaks.",
      "contextHash": "d80830fb689879ba45233c264d8d1632bd3af58cbad93c66c37bd9c8672325f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ＵＲＬの例（外部）",
      "sourceHash": "4a111bed70c4f9f34460f1eb833bb115136d1bc05f08f1695f21365c1ae0f54a",
      "translation": "URL Example (External)",
      "contextHash": "4a111bed70c4f9f34460f1eb833bb115136d1bc05f08f1695f21365c1ae0f54a"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-003",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "https://newrpg.seesaa.net/article/501426741.html",
      "sourceHash": "875529bafffa24e86614120ac42e6300a25549c27651030846f9c04f39715b82",
      "translation": "https://newrpg.seesaa.net/article/501426741.html",
      "contextHash": "844c89aa28c0461b8fea9278e12b2d1bf92474c0c589a0d14f9ace4669932f70"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "このプラグインの記事です。",
      "sourceHash": "4110f640be9272066809fa0f591f8910d79f5d9615327efd84ce02b460738525",
      "translation": "This is a link to the article about this plugin.",
      "contextHash": "4110f640be9272066809fa0f591f8910d79f5d9615327efd84ce02b460738525"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "実際には公式サイトなどへのリンクを想定しています。",
      "sourceHash": "7cf60da91aa93be6c3a423df374a7faf38b79ad7de7ae2a43a131281deea8b06",
      "translation": "It is intended to be used for links to the official website or similar sites.",
      "contextHash": "7cf60da91aa93be6c3a423df374a7faf38b79ad7de7ae2a43a131281deea8b06"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ＵＲＬの例（ローカルファイル）",
      "sourceHash": "a8e96b4f4e706c641c703cf579fdc8905aa1bd55b52302b9f8c091845378c106",
      "translation": "URL Example (Local File)",
      "contextHash": "a8e96b4f4e706c641c703cf579fdc8905aa1bd55b52302b9f8c091845378c106"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "exeファイルと同じ階層にあるManualフォルダの下のindex.htmlを開きます。",
      "sourceHash": "17fa7f65da119d59bad1b7b81771d6bbe328a6e428054a768346b6753e4f12f8",
      "translation": "This opens index.html under the Manual folder, which is in the same directory as the exe file.",
      "contextHash": "17fa7f65da119d59bad1b7b81771d6bbe328a6e428054a768346b6753e4f12f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※/ではなく\\\\で区切る必要があることに注意してください。",
      "sourceHash": "d885c654bdfc784db76b018ddaa4346e54e6dc43d5e536b59a29f8f4f694e554",
      "translation": "※Note that you must use \\\\ as the separator instead of /.",
      "contextHash": "d885c654bdfc784db76b018ddaa4346e54e6dc43d5e536b59a29f8f4f694e554"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "追加コマンドリスト（AddCommandList）",
      "sourceHash": "0118aeb0692004ba8dce0789c007a3309cc5d6e268617ea4ccfb166ba153681c",
      "translation": "Add Command List (AddCommandList)",
      "contextHash": "0118aeb0692004ba8dce0789c007a3309cc5d6e268617ea4ccfb166ba153681c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "タイトルウィンドウに独自コマンドを追加します。",
      "sourceHash": "07b34d614f1a6939b196327def6fcac512d7bcb54db65ccc77d846c9298d5ef9",
      "translation": "Adds custom commands to the title window.",
      "contextHash": "07b34d614f1a6939b196327def6fcac512d7bcb54db65ccc77d846c9298d5ef9"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "制御文字を有効に（UseControlCharacter）",
      "sourceHash": "d891ec9cd3072ec6c8788271d7258ec6b428316642f7f0462544a0765f9b42a9",
      "translation": "Enable Control Characters (UseControlCharacter)",
      "contextHash": "d891ec9cd3072ec6c8788271d7258ec6b428316642f7f0462544a0765f9b42a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "コマンド名に制御文字を有効にします。",
      "sourceHash": "3601561cb555953f70ae8443581f8fb343c7290bc9fab3723d48b8734b076f71",
      "translation": "Enables control characters in command names.",
      "contextHash": "3601561cb555953f70ae8443581f8fb343c7290bc9fab3723d48b8734b076f71"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、副作用で文字の縮小が無効になります。",
      "sourceHash": "b1690ac1de443fc21c1ee09d66f564e5130fcfcc28958cdd032ea6ee43c6b799",
      "translation": "As a side effect, text shrinking is disabled.",
      "contextHash": "b1690ac1de443fc21c1ee09d66f564e5130fcfcc28958cdd032ea6ee43c6b799"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "文字の配置（TextAlign）",
      "sourceHash": "8e08dc6ad7969bc81ec5c049216a9f953cc783bccd13d8b785ebdd6c91224a86",
      "translation": "Text Alignment (TextAlign)",
      "contextHash": "8e08dc6ad7969bc81ec5c049216a9f953cc783bccd13d8b785ebdd6c91224a86"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "コマンド名の配置です。",
      "sourceHash": "a55314068a4c35ad01d4e6ff1b22bb8753d375719654a45ffba103ec54f52640",
      "translation": "The alignment of command names.",
      "contextHash": "a55314068a4c35ad01d4e6ff1b22bb8753d375719654a45ffba103ec54f52640"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ウィンドウの横幅（WindowWidth）",
      "sourceHash": "5247d178907cda05c07a3ba649c22a3690218f154dd8fb3bc5ca250420e30be9",
      "translation": "Window Width (WindowWidth)",
      "contextHash": "5247d178907cda05c07a3ba649c22a3690218f154dd8fb3bc5ca250420e30be9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "タイトルウィンドウの横幅です。",
      "sourceHash": "67461c5b1f2fd83fbc7ae575b2afde79d77cef1e1027b3ae05d45db9c5f6670d",
      "translation": "The width of the title window.",
      "contextHash": "67461c5b1f2fd83fbc7ae575b2afde79d77cef1e1027b3ae05d45db9c5f6670d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "初期値は240です。",
      "sourceHash": "d0da763821ae05faef000e32fa513cf68f4c38cecdd544ba3bb3eabe952a0acd",
      "translation": "The default value is 240.",
      "contextHash": "d0da763821ae05faef000e32fa513cf68f4c38cecdd544ba3bb3eabe952a0acd"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ウィンドウの一行の幅（WindowLineHeight）",
      "sourceHash": "6a6c894b66fe88b3353a00c1d70fcbaf45cab283a447dd34bdfbdcd70f7e0885",
      "translation": "Window Line Height (WindowLineHeight)",
      "contextHash": "6a6c894b66fe88b3353a00c1d70fcbaf45cab283a447dd34bdfbdcd70f7e0885"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ウィンドウの一行の縦幅です。",
      "sourceHash": "574b5ab277240c64b45212004a7f07f4ad6ba89b9518e8d5cd9b421e96652f23",
      "translation": "The height of each line in the window.",
      "contextHash": "574b5ab277240c64b45212004a7f07f4ad6ba89b9518e8d5cd9b421e96652f23"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "空欄なら元の設定を使用します。",
      "sourceHash": "e94db3f702a128c976a4fc34aaf44a267cddb08a4f4b2e624c3040d97237b920",
      "translation": "If left blank, the original setting is used.",
      "contextHash": "e94db3f702a128c976a4fc34aaf44a267cddb08a4f4b2e624c3040d97237b920"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "オプション名（OptionName）",
      "sourceHash": "a515ddc2594845db60005d14da7cd29da9daec187484320097d97db063fae44c",
      "translation": "Option Name (OptionName)",
      "contextHash": "a515ddc2594845db60005d14da7cd29da9daec187484320097d97db063fae44c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オプションの表示名です。",
      "sourceHash": "7abcd764ca5a1faa6363bd71445fedaa553ca1d08600dd756598e4a773b46d6f",
      "translation": "The display name of the option.",
      "contextHash": "7abcd764ca5a1faa6363bd71445fedaa553ca1d08600dd756598e4a773b46d6f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "通常、用語のオプションはメニュー画面と共通ですが、それとは別に指定できます。",
      "sourceHash": "269f64d730148fb267e1e72e715b7476abda29d720b0c8cb6c696e19607868b3",
      "translation": "Normally, the option term is shared with the menu screen, but you can specify a separate name here.",
      "contextHash": "269f64d730148fb267e1e72e715b7476abda29d720b0c8cb6c696e19607868b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "不要なら空欄にしておいてください。",
      "sourceHash": "14b51b8c6909cd35d23f5f22177beb731c4df9616abf8091a0ac3bd8eb8a4bb2",
      "translation": "Leave it blank if it is not needed.",
      "contextHash": "14b51b8c6909cd35d23f5f22177beb731c4df9616abf8091a0ac3bd8eb8a4bb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "BGMをフェードアウトしない（NoBgmFadeOut）",
      "sourceHash": "9873378ddb81694b5f78718c9f7acb266ffae9f18a6fb7fb169e05f2e70339f2",
      "translation": "Do Not Fade Out BGM (NoBgmFadeOut)",
      "contextHash": "9873378ddb81694b5f78718c9f7acb266ffae9f18a6fb7fb169e05f2e70339f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ゲーム開始時にＢＧＭをフェードアウトさせません。",
      "sourceHash": "7e6ec9e66cb038b43a99c0f87ce4f1ecbdfbd063dabc4ba16549269ac1783450",
      "translation": "The BGM does not fade out when the game starts.",
      "contextHash": "7e6ec9e66cb038b43a99c0f87ce4f1ecbdfbd063dabc4ba16549269ac1783450"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "タイトル画面の音楽をそのまま引き継ぎたい場合に。",
      "sourceHash": "af221f5956d3cb87154bf7b47e09570d626233035449c7bca81129dde0c07ecf",
      "translation": "Use this when you want to continue playing the title screen music as is.",
      "contextHash": "af221f5956d3cb87154bf7b47e09570d626233035449c7bca81129dde0c07ecf"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（コマンド）（Command Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "bef971990a82923393f55393ff5b6eb2a80ae5ab492ad8f0048ac67aed4d09a7",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Commands) (Command Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "bef971990a82923393f55393ff5b6eb2a80ae5ab492ad8f0048ac67aed4d09a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-018",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "コマンド名（CommandName）",
      "sourceHash": "9559481480bde5b6427c31f3c6f22f37f26248b37ac3ee807944a4dea14e1b5b",
      "translation": "Command Name (CommandName)",
      "contextHash": "9559481480bde5b6427c31f3c6f22f37f26248b37ac3ee807944a4dea14e1b5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "コマンド名です。",
      "sourceHash": "360201e85873c78db242ea6e1e7c8355e65339b34ffec8ebc37f99e6a9510171",
      "translation": "This is the command name.",
      "contextHash": "360201e85873c78db242ea6e1e7c8355e65339b34ffec8ebc37f99e6a9510171"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-019",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "挿入位置（Position）",
      "sourceHash": "4483661006351dcd2e75e3064ea50d8cb9d677ffb643a176c23bac7f190d9171",
      "translation": "Insertion Position (Position)",
      "contextHash": "4483661006351dcd2e75e3064ea50d8cb9d677ffb643a176c23bac7f190d9171"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-028",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "コマンドを挿入する位置です。",
      "sourceHash": "c6fa2149367f43b08abccecd46a82d881e4a0c159fb7317c5099df4e774de182",
      "translation": "This is the position at which to insert the command.",
      "contextHash": "c6fa2149367f43b08abccecd46a82d881e4a0c159fb7317c5099df4e774de182"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-029",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "0を先頭として設定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "2a0d734f3e8fb6a95b750c15095bc5d5cb77ea2781450a021c1854a21b6be237",
      "translation": "Set the first position to 0.",
      "contextHash": "2a0d734f3e8fb6a95b750c15095bc5d5cb77ea2781450a021c1854a21b6be237"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-020",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スクリプト（Script）",
      "sourceHash": "6c9f87dece54fc9e3b7d05daea689046806d4b618be399a6c1e23b9999cf45ac",
      "translation": "Script (Script)",
      "contextHash": "6c9f87dece54fc9e3b7d05daea689046806d4b618be399a6c1e23b9999cf45ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-030",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "コマンド決定時に実行するスクリプトです。",
      "sourceHash": "772a28b4893ba0bc0c1d58065da67e24ed1848b0acf911b33768dcc7224ce053",
      "translation": "This is the script executed when the command is confirmed.",
      "contextHash": "772a28b4893ba0bc0c1d58065da67e24ed1848b0acf911b33768dcc7224ce053"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-031",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "コマンド決定時にブラウザを開き、ＵＲＬを呼び出します。",
      "sourceHash": "11b2501b3d50ff6b235210bf179e036bdab047a37a9b9fac98f569f3ba24c319",
      "translation": "The browser opens and calls the URL when the command is confirmed.",
      "contextHash": "11b2501b3d50ff6b235210bf179e036bdab047a37a9b9fac98f569f3ba24c319"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-021",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "既定ブラウザを使用（UseDefaultBrowser）",
      "sourceHash": "7504b17bfffa6f7dfb06a25556a0d5298c38157c3b2dd1db40236582ff1cdf6d",
      "translation": "Use Default Browser (UseDefaultBrowser)",
      "contextHash": "7504b17bfffa6f7dfb06a25556a0d5298c38157c3b2dd1db40236582ff1cdf6d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-032",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オンの場合、既定ブラウザでＵＲＬを呼び出します。",
      "sourceHash": "f9c43e0c4a2fee1b3490c02cbde20d53a591022162c8a84816ac49abe683d763",
      "translation": "When enabled, the URL is opened in the default browser.",
      "contextHash": "f9c43e0c4a2fee1b3490c02cbde20d53a591022162c8a84816ac49abe683d763"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-033",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オフの場合、ＯＳの既定のブラウザではなくツクールと同じエンジンで開かれます。",
      "sourceHash": "d624aeb58ce54b157a83ef23555a58ad8058a129f4bbdf39db47e58ee9f2bf87",
      "translation": "When disabled, it is opened using the same engine as RPG Maker instead of the OS's default browser.",
      "contextHash": "d624aeb58ce54b157a83ef23555a58ad8058a129f4bbdf39db47e58ee9f2bf87"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-034",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※既定のブラウザで開いた場合、作者環境では異様に起動が遅い現象が発生しました。原因不明ですが、2026/4/8現在では発生しなくなりました。他の方の環境でどうなるのかは不明ですが、ご注意ください。",
      "sourceHash": "1dacc3a2f4623fe6f7863e4cb574211f325f4e2517960ecf6cb93beb741d910b",
      "translation": "※When opened in the default browser, an unusually long startup time occurred in my environment. The cause is unknown, but as of 2026/4/8, this no longer occurs. It is unknown what will happen in other users' environments, so please be careful.",
      "contextHash": "1dacc3a2f4623fe6f7863e4cb574211f325f4e2517960ecf6cb93beb741d910b"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "この他にも、大掛かりな演出などをお求めの方は[[LINK_1]]マップをタイトル画面として使用するプラグイン[[/LINK_1]]をオススメします。",
      "sourceHash": "bc8887b396c447fcb229175cb002c59f8f073191a2e242d6d2a1667ee5bbf9c4",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "この他にも、大掛かりな演出などをお求めの方は",
          "link": false
