          "source": "マップをタイトル画面として使用するプラグイン",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "をオススメします。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "In addition, if you are looking for more elaborate effects, I recommend the [[LINK_1]]plugin that uses a map as the title screen[[/LINK_1]].",
      "contextHash": "bc8887b396c447fcb229175cb002c59f8f073191a2e242d6d2a1667ee5bbf9c4"
    },
