    },
    {
      "id": "line-020",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "ゲーム内用語辞典プラグイン（[[LINK_1]]SceneGlossary.js[[/LINK_1]]）を呼び出します。",
      "sourceHash": "c846382e7493758f69e15735feba66388e09b97610f009ea4a779a731efead5f",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "ゲーム内用語辞典プラグイン（",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "SceneGlossary.js",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "）を呼び出します。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "This calls the in-game glossary plugin ([[LINK_1]]SceneGlossary.js[[/LINK_1]]).",
      "contextHash": "c846382e7493758f69e15735feba66388e09b97610f009ea4a779a731efead5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-021",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "詳細は[[LINK_1]]プラグインパラメータ（コマンド）[[/LINK_1]]をご覧ください。",
      "sourceHash": "c8fd5f916c8165254fc07760dff53e3fd62f6703e4cbf79047ee98fcd70ba54d",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "詳細は",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "プラグインパラメータ（コマンド）",
          "link": true,
